          "id": "10342",
          "body": "CROSS-REFERENCES ADDED — 2026-07-28 (Additional User Stories reconciliation)\n\nNo scope change, but three live dependencies should be on the record:\n\n1\\. INTERIM ACCESS STATE: Jared has been granted three permission set groups directly for demo purposes (BUILD-26 / Doc #15). This must be reconciled against the four-tier model before go-live. It is not the model.\n\n2\\. Sign-Up ownership moves to the Brand Ambassador under BUILD-38 (Doc #16), with a Custom Setting fallback user. The sharing design must account for the fallback (Jumpr Solutions) user holding records.\n\n3\\. Rep-only Console list views (BUILD-37 / Doc #14) are a GO-LIVE GATE and depend on this ticket's sharing model. Views are currently open to all users for UAT.",
